  "product": "cardiotox_TOP2",
  "recipe": "Pool an entered class's drug wells into one Disease group against the same-plate/same-time vehicle in each source stratum, using the source's own test (DToxS GSE217421 pinned edgeR pipeline on its read counts; DESeq2 on GSE243674 counts with the item's donor-paired design; the declared Welch test on GSE244740 ScreenSeq counts). Align the per-stratum contrasts to the frozen 18,164 gene_index axis and collapse per gene by the maximum |log2FC| x -log10(padj) effect (ticket #186's deg_rank contract), then publish the compact table and the within-dataset rank rank_norm = rank / n_measured with unmeasured genes at n_measured + 1. No fusion, no axis and no view is computed.",
